      "text": "Targets\n• Redirect p95 <150 ms @100 rps\n• Management p95 <500 ms\n• State change visible ≤5 s\n• 99.5% best-effort uptime\n• Never reuse deleted codes\n\nFR-RED-* • FR-MGT-*\nNFR-PER-* • NFR-CON-*",
